// simplified (Douglas-Peucker) and rounded to 0.1 units. Simplification is why
// this is ~58KB rather than ~250KB; it is a choropleth, not a survey, so the
// coastline detail that costs the bytes buys nothing here.
//
// Regenerate rather than hand-editing: the paths are meaningless as text.

